00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:08.942 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Comme une prémonition,

00:00:06.907 --> 00:00:10.076 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le créateur du film C.R.A.Z.Y.,

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:11.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
