00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.083 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est un choc, en fait.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:18.251 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le réalisteur serait mort

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:19.419 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de causes naturelles dans un

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:20.620 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chalet à Berthier-sur-Mer,

00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:21.788 size:53% position:73% line:53%
près de Québec. Sa disparition

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:22.956 size:53% position:73% line:53%
crée un grand vide.

00:00:20.921 --> 00:00:24.624 size:53% position:73% line:53%
DENIS VILLENEUVE, réalisateur

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:25.792 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Jean-Marc c'est un géant,

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:27.694 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est énorme ce qui se passe.

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:28.862 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Tu vas pas publier sa maudite

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:31.198 size:53% position:73% line:53%
liste...

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:32.399 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Son premier long métrage,

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:33.566 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Liste Noire" en 1995, attireles

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:34.734 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est avec C.R.A.Z.Y que

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.902 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Jean-Marc Vallée récolte

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:37.337 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'attention du monde entier,

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:38.505 size:53% position:73% line:53%
